tanding."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l036","ordinal":348226,"en":"When he gathered himself and charged,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l037","ordinal":348227,"en":"No man could withstand him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l038","ordinal":348228,"en":"When they saw my true father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l039","ordinal":348229,"en":"All the people of Chinmachin wept."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l040","ordinal":348230,"en":"Before my father, let alone Sarybai,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l001","ordinal":348231,"en":"Then the hero Seytek,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l002","ordinal":348232,"en":"His heart straying and troubled,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l003","ordinal":348233,"en":"Saw countless disasters and afflictions"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l004","ordinal":348234,"en":"Looming close before his eyes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l005","ordinal":348235,"en":"Calling upon the Creator for aid,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l006","ordinal":348236,"en":"Sparing not his life in the struggle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l007","ordinal":348237,"en":"Ready to die if true death had come,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l008","ordinal":348238,"en":"But if he remained alive,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l009","ordinal":348239,"en":"To stand as a shelter"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l010","ordinal":348240,"en":"For his uncle Külchoro."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l011","ordinal":348241,"en":"He resolved to wage fierce battle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l012","ordinal":348242,"en":"And rescue Külchoro, his guardian,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l013","ordinal":348243,"en":"From the infidel’s venomous bullet."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l014","ordinal":348244,"en":"He would deliver him"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l015","ordinal":348245,"en":"From the iron-rope net,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l016","ordinal":348246,"en":"From the deep-dug pit,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l017","ordinal":348247,"en":"From the blazing bed of coals,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l018","ordinal":348248,"en":"From the monster’s hands."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l019","ordinal":348249,"en":"“If the moon is veiled in darkness,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l020","ordinal":348250,"en":"What will become of the night?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l021","ordinal":348251,"en":"If my valiant uncle Külchoro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l022","ordinal":348252,"en":"Falls into the infidel’s hands,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l023","ordinal":348253,"en":"What will become of his days?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l024","ordinal":348254,"en":"May I be accursed if I do not act!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l025","ordinal":348255,"en":"Let me be a sheltering ridge,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l026","ordinal":348256,"en":"A visible source of strength and courage,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l027","ordinal":348257,"en":"A support around his waist,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l028","ordinal":348258,"en":"And become his true companion."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l029","ordinal":348259,"en":"From the wrathful dog’s hands,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l030","ordinal":348260,"en":"My valiant uncle Choro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l031","ordinal":348261,"en":"I shall rescue."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l032","ordinal":348262,"en":"He never watched idly while others fought;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l033","ordinal":348263,"en":"He guarded me like a father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l034","ordinal":348264,"en":"And cared for me like a mother."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l035","ordinal":348265,"en":"He was a towering black mountain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l036","ordinal":348266,"en":"A lofty crag of such height"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l037","ordinal":348267,"en":"That no surging host could cross it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l038","ordinal":348268,"en":"Will he break through my crag?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l0